{"channelId":"UCFo91jLFqXR7bMwkmGTFICg","row":["halorescue",299,"HALO is a No-kill, 501c3 non-profit organization dedicated to Helping Animals Live On through increased adoption, sterilization and pet care education.\n\nHALO was founded in 1994 by two women, Michel and Heather, out of their home in Phoenix, Arizona. Michel and Heather started HALO because they love animals and couldn't just stand by and watch millions of cats and dogs being killed needlessly.\n\nHALO provides temporary shelter to abandoned cats and dogs until they can be adopted into a permanent home.\n\nEach year, HALO places over 3,000 abandoned animals in loving, forever homes.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFo91jLFqXR7bMwkmGTFICg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFo91jLFqXR7bMwkmGTFICg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:42.009Z","channelId":"UCFo91jLFqXR7bMwkmGTFICg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"9f02d70dac3d44d4ec7a070e86549e1f524c3411c2a6b7d5da90f529fd9f7a3d","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"744f5a19da5670bb80ce39a53905005d48ca42992d9abf2e134945c36d9f5af5"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFo91jLFqXR7bMwkmGTFICg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":299,"raw":"299 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFo91jLFqXR7bMwkmGTFICg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:42.009Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"organization_self_report","flags":[],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"undetermined","excerpt":"HALO is a No-kill, 501c3 non-profit organization dedicated to Helping Animals Live On through increased adoption, sterilization and pet care edu